    "props": {
      "also_text": "Fisher, Angler, Uotsukai",
      "benefit_dropdown": "hp_benefit",
      "classMechanic_text": "",
      "class_lore": "<blockquote><p><em><strong>Tidehunter</strong></em> hail from the Summerlands’ lantern-lit piers, where nets are heirlooms and tide charts hang beside family altars. Raised on brine and boatcraft, they learn star routes, shoals, and riptides as early as their letters. Work-tools became war-tools: the barbed spear for clean pins, the weighted line and flail for drag, trip, and bind.</p><p>On the littoral they are guardians and guides, turning water from hazard into home ground. Against aquatic beasts they strike with practiced calm—reading fins, gills, and currents to break a foe’s rhythm—while steering allies through flood and surf. Hire one when the road is a river; follow when the map ends and the tides begin.</p></blockquote>",
      "flavor_text": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: Amiri\"><em>Chart the current;</em></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center\"><span style=\"font-family: Amiri\"><em>trust the knot. When the tide turns,</em></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center\"><span style=\"font-family: Amiri\"><em>so do we.</em></span></p>",
